OpenUSD
-------
License: Tomorrow Open Source Technology License 1.0 (TOST-1.0)
https://openusd.org/license

The usdview node-graph editor under plugin/usdNoodles was localized from
OpenUSD PR #4156 (pxr/usdImaging/usdNoodles). A copy of the TOST text is
checked in at plugin/usdNoodles/LICENSE.txt.

plugin/usdNoodles/moduleDeps.cpp is the OpenUSD pxr_library script-module
dependency table (Copyright 2024 Pixar). Its header still points at
https://openusd.org/license.

libs/rigExecRuntime/runtimeMath.h is partly derived from OpenUSD Gf math.
It repeats the same floating-point operations in the same order as the Gf
subset the runtime kernels use, including Gf's short-vector and reciprocal
behavior, and it compiles without an OpenUSD include path. Its header
keeps the OpenUSD TOST notice (https://openusd.org/license).

